        {"id": "s3", "text": "to anyone outside the executive team.", "clickable": false}
      ],
      "explanation": "Topic: Advanced 'Would rather'. When 'would rather' is followed by a different subject ('you'), the verb must be in the past subjunctive ('did not disclose') to refer to a present or future preference."
    },
    {
      "id": "q45",
      "type": "multi_error",
      "question": "Click on error(s) and type correction.",
      "sentence": "Supposing the heavy rainfall continues throughout the week, the agricultural committee will declare a state of emergency.",
