        {"id": "s3", "text": "will declare a state of emergency.", "clickable": true, "isError": false}
      ],
      "explanation": "Topic: 'Supposing' Conditionals. No error. 'Supposing' functions identically to 'if' in conditional sentences and is correctly followed by the present simple tense for a real future possibility."
    },
    {
      "id": "q46",
      "type": "multi_error",
      "question": "Identify all errors (word, phrase, or clause).",
      "sentence": "Although the heavy monsoon rains, the construction of the new toll road in Sumatra proceeded according to schedule.",
