        {"id": "s3", "text": "the implications of their findings.", "clickable": false}
      ],
      "explanation": "Topic: 'Not until' Inversion. No error. The sentence correctly uses inversion in the main clause ('did the researchers fully understand') after a fronted 'Not until' phrase."
    },
    {
